<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48504" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tŏmis</span></b> , is, f.,
		or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tŏmi</span></b> ,
			ōrum, m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τόμις</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τόμοι,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a town of
				Mœsia</i>, <i>on the Pontus
			Euxinus</i>, <i>famous as the place to which Ovid was
				banished.</i>—Form Tomis, <i><span class="en">Ov. P. 4,
				14, 59</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Tr. 3, 9, 33</span></i>.—Form
				Tŏmi, ōrum, m.,
				<i><span class="en">Stat. S. 1, 2, 254</span></i>; Claud. Epith. Pall.
			et Celer. 70; <i><span class="en">Sid. Carm. 23,
			159</span></i>.—And after the Greek orthog., <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tŏmoe</span></b> , <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 2,
			5</span></i>. — Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tŏmītae</span></b> ,
				ārum, m., <i>the inhabitants of Tomis</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. Tr. 1,
				2, 85</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tŏmītānus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to Tomis</i>, <i>Tomitan</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">terra,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. P.
					1, 1, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">harena,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					ib. 1, 6, 49</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nurus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					ib. 3, 8, 10</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
